   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Netherlands Enterprise Agency</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Start-up and Scale-up Coordination Mechanism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Uganda, the challenges of the private sector and limited space for governmental cooperation, hinders economic opportunities to be maximally utilized. In such, Non Governmental Organisations, donors and other stakeholders try to bridge this gap.  However, a proper coordination mechanism to coordinate and synchronize the various initiatives to maximize their impact, is absent. Start-ups and Scale-ups thrive on supportive programs and initiatives and are important accelerators of job creation of economic development. Therefore, this project tries to map the challenges and opportunities of the start-up and scale-up ecosystem in Uganda and bridge the gap in knowledge.</narrative>
  </description>
